- [SUM-1] The plan needs one repository-grounded verification correction.

## What Came Up Short
- [PA-001] Step: [S-2] Observation: S-2 names a nonexistent test path. Cost: the executor cannot run the promised proof. Fix: replace it with the repository's real focused test command.

## How To Fix
- [PA-001] Rewrite S-2 and its completion evidence with the verified test path and expected passing result.
